            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Invoca <code>setTimeout()</code> con la funzione di callback e un ritardo di <code>1000</code> millisecondi.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>setTimeout</code>, seguito da <code>(</code> e poi <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
